Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.23,0:12:39.63,Solo-Italics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Há inúmeros deles, e ficam\Nmais fortes conforme eu subo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.63,0:12:43.88,Solo-Italics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Mas matar só os demônios necessários\Npara subir em cada andar
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.88,0:12:45.66,Solo-Italics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,me permitiu progredir bem rápido.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.08,0:12:46.87,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(184,1)\an7\bord1.5\p1)\c&H2A0F1C&\3a&H00&\1a&H8B&\3c&HCDABBD&\pos(21.33,19.26)}m 0 0 l 250 0 250 180 0 180
