Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.94,0:16:02.52,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HFBF7E1&\3c&HA9976D&\fnArial\blur5\fs14\pos(498.45,163.89)}Toque do Dominador\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hNv. 2
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.91,0:16:11.45,Solo-Italics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Essa coisa prevê os meus movimentos?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.88,0:16:16.16,Solo-Italics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,A única parte que parece vulnerável\Nsão aqueles olhinhos brilhantes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.87,0:16:23.79,Solo-Italics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Preciso impedi-lo de se mover\Ntão rapidamente.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.88,0:16:25.75,Solo-Italics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,O que posso usar?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.34,0:16:28.43,Solo-Italics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Aquilo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.39,0:16:42.35,Solo-Main,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Ficou focado demais em mim, hein?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.37,0:17:00.25,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HFBF7E1&\3c&HA9976D&\fnArial\blur5\b0\pos(328.45,56.89)}Notificação
