Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.19,0:23:40.94,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\an1\fad(1322,1)\fs16\c&HFDF5F9&\3c&HB1096A&\blur3\b0\pos(277.02,204.22)}Preciso parar de fingir
